  "body_html": "<p><strong>What another absolutely beautiful week in the stock market! #sarcasm 😂</strong></p><p>Jokes aside, I know many of you, especially the short term traders, are ITCHING for a trade. Dying for me to post a signal. Sorry, but not really sorry….<em><strong>you will not get it from me at this point in time. </strong></em></p><p>You want to beat the indexes? Have a great 2026 performance? That means sitting on your hands when the market is not conforming to your (or really my) strategy. The <strong>trend has been down</strong>, locally, as depicted in the sea of red on the 1 month S&amp;P 500 Index heatmap. If you go buy 1 stock or even 10 stocks…odds are, most of them will be losers. Don’t fight the odds. We have been sitting out since February for a reason. </p><h4>I’d rather be bored and watch some of you all squirm, than try to force bad trades, where we all lose money. </h4><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sg75!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F66ee0e64-f18f-4e1e-acb8-cadb9ae68d53_1450x787.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sg75!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F66ee0e64-f18f-4e1e-acb8-cadb9ae68d53_1450x787.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sg75!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F66ee0e64-f18f-4e1e-acb8-cadb9ae68d53_1450x787.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sg75!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F66ee0e64-f18f-4e1e-acb8-cadb9ae68d53_1450x787.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sg75!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F66ee0e64-f18f-4e1e-acb8-cadb9ae68d53_1450x787.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sg75!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F66ee0e64-f18f-4e1e-acb8-cadb9ae68d53_1450x787.png\" width=\"1450\" height=\"787\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/66ee0e64-f18f-4e1e-acb8-cadb9ae68d53_1450x787.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:787,&quot;width&quot;:1450,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:227827,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/191603160?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F66ee0e64-f18f-4e1e-acb8-cadb9ae68d53_1450x787.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sg75!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F66ee0e64-f18f-4e1e-acb8-cadb9ae68d53_1450x787.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sg75!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F66ee0e64-f18f-4e1e-acb8-cadb9ae68d53_1450x787.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sg75!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F66ee0e64-f18f-4e1e-acb8-cadb9ae68d53_1450x787.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sg75!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F66ee0e64-f18f-4e1e-acb8-cadb9ae68d53_1450x787.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Most assets have been going down. Stop fighting trends. Dip buyers have been crushed.</figcaption></figure></div><p>So when are we going to start trading again? What rules am I waiting on to pull the trigger again? This is not an all inclusive list but some of the key elements. </p><ol><li><p>The VIX must be below 21. Period. </p><ol><li><p>The VIX started testing out the “21” region in mid-February. That is when we halted all trading. In hindsight, that was a good decision. It has continuously been pushing higher. Dip buyers and DCA folks have been getting wrecked from this bad habit. </p></li></ol></li><li><p>The S&amp;P 500 must regain lost ground. </p><ol><li><p>To be clear, its really not that bad, even today, we are only -6.2% away from all time highs and still above the lows from November 2025. Of course it can get worse before it gets better…but <em><strong>let price action do that talking</strong></em>. Price action is weak for the broader market, at the moment. Recently it broke below the 200 day moving average. Don’t let a bad situation become a horrific situation. </p></li></ol></li><li><p>A Sector “pops”</p><ol><li><p>Remember when AI took off? That was a big clue that we were going to have some bullish sector rotations. I didn’t necessarily catch AI as it was the initial pumps…but we caught things like Energy and Quantum Computing later on. Let a sector pop off, then we can start tracking down what sectors are next. </p></li></ol></li></ol><p>I love investing and trading. But <strong>I love making money more</strong>. Right now, is just not a good time. Be patient, and wait for the setups to work, and for it to be “easy”. I wish I had better news, but I do not control the markets. </p><h4>When will the stock market pain end? </h4><p>Not I, or anyone in the world <em><strong>truly knows</strong></em>. I still see a lot of great MACRO setups, so my speculation is not much longer. Maybe April? Good news, I am going on vacation March 27th to April 8th. The market ALWAYS goes up when I go on vacation LOL. <em><strong>Always!</strong></em></p><h4>Should you buy or sell?</h4><p>This is kind of dependent on your strategy and timeframe reference. I have a few long term holdings, based off the monthly, that look fine. If I was holding them for just a few weeks though, they would have been cut a few weeks ago. Look at your positions, and ask yourself</p><ul><li><p> “What is my cut price?” or </p></li><li><p>“Where can I not take any more losses that will drastically impact my portfolio equity for the year?” or </p></li><li><p>If your position is in profit “What % of profits do I not want to let go?”</p></li></ul><p>Everyone’s answers will be different. But build the game plan. Follow the game plan. This is what will keep you in the game in the long term. Sometimes the game plan will go to shit…so adjust. Its ok! </p><p>Some of these influencers out there, are pumping out content, just to pump out content. Their main goal is more subscribers…not being the best investor. If you want to fight the market, then by all means, un-subscribe to me, and go subscribe to them! I will not send you e-mails during these periods of shitty market. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0d4a!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3b99adab-dbcd-4df9-92e0-2d0385e70fda_519x538.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0d4a!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3b99adab-dbcd-4df9-92e0-2d0385e70fda_519x538.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0d4a!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3b99adab-dbcd-4df9-92e0-2d0385e70fda_519x538.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0d4a!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3b99adab-dbcd-4df9-92e0-2d0385e70fda_519x538.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0d4a!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3b99adab-dbcd-4df9-92e0-2d0385e70fda_519x538.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0d4a!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3b99adab-dbcd-4df9-92e0-2d0385e70fda_519x538.png\" width=\"519\" height=\"538\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/3b99adab-dbcd-4df9-92e0-2d0385e70fda_519x538.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:538,&quot;width&quot;:519,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:67731,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/191603160?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3b99adab-dbcd-4df9-92e0-2d0385e70fda_519x538.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0d4a!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3b99adab-dbcd-4df9-92e0-2d0385e70fda_519x538.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0d4a!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3b99adab-dbcd-4df9-92e0-2d0385e70fda_519x538.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0d4a!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3b99adab-dbcd-4df9-92e0-2d0385e70fda_519x538.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0d4a!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3b99adab-dbcd-4df9-92e0-2d0385e70fda_519x538.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Ok, rant over. I genuinely hope you all have a nice weekend. </p><p>Take time away from the charts. Having went through 2022 (and 2020 and 2018 and 2008)…DO NOT STARE AT THE CHARTS. Your eyeballs will not change the price action lol. Relax, take some time off. I will let you know when I think the tides are turning, <em><strong>you do not need to catch the bottom. The market will come back, eventually. </strong></em></p><p>Thanks for stopping by! </p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Summary</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-stocktok-playbook-everything?r=4z8lgl\">The StockTok Playbook</a></strong></em> <em><strong>|</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Resources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
